```rust
struct BaseConnection {
    timeout: u32,
}
impl BaseConnection {
    fn connect(&self) { /* ... */ }
}

struct HttpConnection {
    base: BaseConnection, // Composition mimicking subclass inheritance
}
impl HttpConnection {
    fn make_request(&self) {
        // Reaching directly into "parent" base field
        self.base.connect();
    }
}
```

fix:
Use trait composition and delegate only what is necessary, protecting the interface boundary.
```rust
trait Connection {
    fn connect(&self);
}
```
